I. THIRD-PARTY CLOUD / SAAS APIS (Proprietary terms — not OSS)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These services are used under each provider's terms and API agreements. They are
not licensed as open source under this MIT grant:

1. Groq Cloud API — AI case analysis / translation (when configured)
2. OpenAI API — optional LLM / embeddings fallback (when configured)
3. Supabase Cloud — database, storage, vector search (when configured)
4. PayMongo — GCash / checkout payments (test or live keys)
5. Google OAuth, Google Fonts CDN, Google STUN (WebRTC)
6. Semaphore — SMS OTP (when configured)
7. Resend — transactional email (when configured)
8. PeerJS public cloud / TURN — WebRTC signaling and relay defaults

See docs/legal/PRIVACY_POLICY.md for processor disclosure under RA 10173.

